<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech fund SPIF Cesky approves czk 18 gross div.</title>
<headline>Czech fund SPIF Cesky approves czk 18 gross div.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Czech investment fund Sporitelni Privatizacni - Cesky Investicni Fond a.s. agreed at Thursday's annual general meeting to pay out an 18 crown per share gross dividend on 1996 earnings, after eight crowns paid on profit from the previous year.</p>
</text>
